=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Datta} to begin the quest.
* Form a party with at least 2 people below level 40.
** {p:Trusts|Trust} and {p:Adventuring Fellows|Adventuring Fellow} do not count toward the requirements.
** {p:Level Sync} does work.
* Head to {z:Kuftal Tunnel} and examine the **???** near the entrance for a cutscene.
** The {p:Survival Guide} is right at this entrance.
** If you don't have that, you can purchase a {p:Chocobo} in {z:Rabao} to cross the desert without having to worry about aggro.
** The only monsters near the **???** are {m:Sand Lizards|Sand Lizard} that don't aggro.
* Once you get the cutscene in {z:Kuftal Tunnel}, return to {n:Datta} for your reward.

=2 Notes
Similar to {M:When Wills Collide|When Wills Collide|When Wills Collide}, {p:Mercenary Camp}, and {q:The Gustaberg Tour|The Gustaberg Tour|The Gustaberg Tour}, this CS displays fellow party members, a very rare occurrence.
* You and your party members overlook the Kuftal tunnel. It's not much of a different angle than you'd see in-game.
* You can watch this CS again with the Goblin Footprint after returning to {n:Datta}.

Originally this quest required 6 players, but the requirement was reduced to 2 with the {p:June 2015 Update|https://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/47481-Jun-25-2015-%28JST%29-Version-Update}.
